   "Representative uses: INSTRUCTION:\n\nHere is an excerpt from a vendor services agreement: Section 4.2 lets the vendor subcontract any portion of the work without notice; Section 7.1 has the client indemnify the vendor for any third-party claim regardless of fault. What issues should I flag before signing?\n\nREADS: (none)\nWRITES: (none)\nMCP-TOOLS: (none)\nBROWSER-TOOLS: (none)."
